{"id":"0e138b4c93cfb69a","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence.md","title":"组合公理独立性的模型判据","display":"lem-compositional-axiom-independence — 组合公理独立性的模型判据","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence","aliases":["91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence","91-lem-comp-axiom-indep","91-lem-axiom-necessity"],"display":"lem-compositional-axiom-independence — 组合公理独立性的模型判据","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","[[91-df-conjunction-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence</span><span>91-lem-comp-axiom-indep</span><span>91-lem-axiom-necessity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-compositional-axiom-independence — 组合公理独立性的模型判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8841d990db08f7a2\" href=\"?note=8841d990db08f7a2\" title=\"91-df-conjunction-axiom\">91-df-conjunction-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (基础理论的句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr C\">\\(\\mathscr C\\)</span> (由若干组合公理集组成的族)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathscr C\">\\(C\\in\\mathscr C\\)</span> (待检验的一个公理集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (一阶结构)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\forall C\\in\\mathscr C\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in C\\,\n\\left[\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak M\\models\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup(\\mathscr C\\setminus\\{C\\})\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\not\\models\\sigma\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup(\\mathscr C\\setminus\\{C\\})\n\\nvdash\\sigma\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\forall C\\in\\mathscr C\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in C\\,\n\\left[\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak M\\models\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup(\\mathscr C\\setminus\\{C\\})\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\not\\models\\sigma\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup(\\mathscr C\\setminus\\{C\\})\n\\nvdash\\sigma\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是由一阶逻辑可靠性得到的相对独立性判据。要断言某个具体组合模式\n独立，必须给出满足其余模式而使该模式失败的结构，并固定编码、基础\n理论、归纳模式和允许的参数。</p>\n<p>因此不能只凭“合取、否定、量词处理不同联结词”就写出三条不可推导式；\n那些式子是需要模型证明的结论，而不是组合公理名称本身的逻辑后果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conjunction-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"8841d990db08f7a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conjunction-axiom]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathscr C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\forall C\\in\\mathscr C\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in C\\,\n\\left[\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak M\\models\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup(\\mathscr C\\setminus\\{C\\})\n\\land\n\\mathfrak M\\not\\models\\sigma\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\bigcup(\\mathscr C\\setminus\\{C\\})\n\\nvdash\\sigma\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-compositional-axiom-independence]]"}],"outgoing":["b0b2a8b496dd82c3","8841d990db08f7a2"]}